    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:524ea7f44af08bfb6fc2a744",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・开始倾泻的感情",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ddfce6a5ed881f8a52a1bfb8deebb9897287324d608d789e4f49af480f2688",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:839c5bd7f3b8e5b85ac8cb9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠在“皋月赏”落败。\n经典路线是道难以跨越的高墙。\n这场高水准的比赛令观众们为之沸腾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac26d49076269e7e2daca7a2f7a468ec4865646d3a576c2651f22ad6d36e4879",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:047e412809f6bde94033cefb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其中成田白仁的跑法更是格外引人注目。\n见识那自己所不具备的超乎常理的犀利跑法，\n樱花桂冠感到──",
      "source_fingerprint": "05354209f900b84029242e310c6df7049f1d2234060090b55986aae1e83fd41a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86a2de44242f27a500d3c19d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好想赢过最强的跑法──\n她涌起了沸腾般的渴望。\n想在“日本德比”一决高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4abc915e8b2a86c41612598c3aaa0884e0442414178c0a485474c86afbf4573",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2115dc828c7e12a141c222e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决定同世代顶点的比赛。\n樱花桂冠的心已被一辈子只能挑战一次的\n“日本德比”彻底掳获。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8bc4386f7d6acb607eb8629d42ec27f14a46d28a6bc0e76feb38b4f9f6461b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433836c9acdad85f5c26690f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・原来这就是",
      "source_fingerprint": "51d546a33b7f4a5c131c13fba1634097b10a223f7bd242c5621bf0951b5e8d4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c930593f9608fc1330077eb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:056b6d8c28f8cb5d84ad7f26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠来到会场观战“皋月赏”。\n经典路线首战现场气氛异常热烈，\n她和在场观众皆期待看到成田白仁的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeb182d60bb522c82384aa9d532f7be11416a04359beef298ac14ff378782a41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:324c48dabc69228fd757d53e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6e85d7e4554a4c929394596",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而成田白仁以压倒性的强悍称霸“皋月赏”。\n全场为之沸腾，\n最强称号迅速深植人心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded442968286527fa1d69c717a512cfe3c78cabc3ed3a4c99b749944d03648a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0b814cc22a4840239422b51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
