    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec8e8f691e1f54ae6282a618",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "使得樱花桂冠的憧憬之心又更为强烈。\n自己办不到的跑法，\n足以击垮一切的理想跑法──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9351a5866ae590f0fa2b94cb849f4a188c3e8da5a6bd2aa1656982cd92eb3f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076422.json",
      "json_path": [
