      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36f479abd71788a38681841a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁也为了登上大舞台之日，\n正竭尽所能地锻炼。\n那模样令樱花桂冠也不禁跟着使出全力冲刺。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69fdefadd4372851c3d2663d4f0c9c55675948be18f2ee0180420a0207424eb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
