      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──结果造成了轻度肌肉拉伤。\n她仍表现得如往常般开朗，\n并说这是个能借此明白自己极限的好机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd1a6e30ef215731ac98fb3498331bc1acefaa4d5bbe0c80d7d42b00fc8816a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
