    {
      "uid": "zhcn:177bac8ed0ea27bc43217703",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "开始起跑了，\n成田白仁的强大实力令樱花桂冠移不开视线。\n那身影实在太过强悍、太过耀眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cec95b75ea3b72d75180aafa00adaefb419d471266979674ff6be68e82e0b8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
