    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6a368249d482096410abce5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想必成田白仁还会继续变得更强吧。\n甚至希望她能大幅增强实力。\n希望她能够强得在“菊花赏”上胜过所有对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6168ce5c654343da946b12580445f78263c1e2ac7c5f1ae7865029efc0e680da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
