      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样未来就能有亲手打败成田白仁的机会。\n樱花桂冠开始笔直地朝着憧憬向前迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67d90bafe5bf3f999275f9fbd4ed9b65f99b73d9b41024f3835269b924ea7882",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
