      "uid": "zhcn:7184f7f3aa77ace0b39fdcd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“菊花赏”的赢家是成田白仁。\n她的勇猛跑姿震撼了在场所有人，\n观众席为之热烈沸腾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "869c203322004e5d2b5cc6e34fa119e9e7a6152b362cae41a88316d437f24faa",
