    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d861e9da85974754a170c879",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这也是一种信任的表现。\n相信憧憬的人会一直跑在自己前面。\n所以自己也要为了超越对方而专注地投入准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc41863bf16213c113b35521572a55e51ee84b636d6db8a40221ddeb922dc85f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
