      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后传来快报，\n琵琶晨光于“天皇赏（秋）”负伤，\n同时还发表了往后预定赛程全都因此取消。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b841c0130b0d7bc7427ef97efad2b3d1744b395990146c52be12e6709a29f88d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
